#: main.cpp:38
msgid ""
"A program for creating quizzes of various complexity ranging from support "
"for\n"
"the classic bsd-game 'quiz' to the (planned) practice questions for the "
"Finnish driver's\n"
"license test."
msgstr ""
"Un programa para criar cuestionários de diversa complexidade, desde o\n"
"xogo clásico dbsd \"quiz\" até (nun futuro) as cuestións do exame do permiso\n"
"de conduzón Finlandés."

